Package: tidypptsda
Title: Process and Analyse Pig Performance Testing Station Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Meng", "Guo", , "tony2015116@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools to clean and analyse visit records from automatic pig
    feeding stations (NEDAP and FIRE). Covers data import, preprocessing,
    the 16 feeder error criteria of Casey et al. (2005)
    <doi:10.2527/2005.835969x>, body weight cleaning with robust
    regression, average daily gain, feed intake correction with a linear
    mixed model as in Jiao et al. (2014) <doi:10.2527/jas.2013-7338>, feed
    conversion ratio and plotting.
